\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Radial Cantor subdivision with generation-aligned azimuthal splitting and axial stepping: $2^3$ $(r, \theta , z)$ factorial ablation, 3D geometric descriptors ($P_{\rm  edge}, A_{\rm  sidewall}, g_{r,\rm  harm}$), exact $A_{\rm  tooth}=0.3049\ \mu \text  {m}^2$ matched evaluation, $(\theta ,z)$ phase permutations, exact $b=3$ scaling variants, optimized/clearance-matched non-fractal controls, and 3-tier nested physical-resolution convergence in vacuum ($\varepsilon _{\rm  bg}=1.0$).} All configurations span the identical $N=3$ annulus $R \in [0.3{}, 1.65{}]\ \mu \text  {m}$ with invariant recessed stator landing-pad elevation $z_{\rm  pad,top} = -115\text  { nm}$, azimuthal tooth envelope $\le 28^\circ $ inside $36^\circ $ stator apertures, minimum tooth width $\ge 20.0\text  { nm}$, minimum radial clearance $\ge 15{}\text  { nm}$, and minimum axial clearance $\ge 15{}\text  { nm}$, evaluated at $\theta = 3^\circ $ in 3D Vector-Dyadic BEM. Upper panel: Standard sharp-edge ($r_{\rm  edge}=0$, $n_\xi = 24$) benchmark listing the upgrade tuple $(u_r, u_\theta , u_z)$, primary slots / stator sub-slots / internal stator sub-ribs / rotor sub-teeth / azimuthal lobes per $90^\circ $ sector, active tooth top-face area $A_{\rm  tooth}$, horizontal edge perimeter $P_{\rm  edge}$, vertical sidewall area $A_{\rm  sidewall}$, harmonic-mean radial clearance $g_{r,\rm  harm}$, disengaged repulsive axial force $F_z(3^\circ )$ at nominal area ($0.3104\ \mu \text  {m}^2$, or $0.3049\ \mu \text  {m}^2$ when capped at $\Delta \theta _{\max }=28^\circ $) and at exact \texttt  {F3-111}-matched area ($A_{\rm  tooth} = 0.3049\ \mu \text  {m}^2$), and force densities normalized by top-face area ($F_z/A_{\rm  tooth}$), edge perimeter ($F_z/P_{\rm  edge}$), and vertical sidewall area ($F_z/A_{\rm  sidewall}$), alongside $(\theta ,z)$ phase permutations, exact $b=3$ scaling variants, primary-budget optimized non-fractal controls (\texttt  {M4}), and $g_r = 15\text  { nm}$ perimeter/sidewall-matched 12-trench controls (\texttt  {M1}--\texttt  {M3}). Lower panel: 3-tier nested physical-resolution convergence (Tiers~1--3) at $r_{\rm  edge} = 5\text  { nm}$ and $10\text  { nm}$.}}{45}{table.ext.2}\protected@file@percent }
